NAME
       vgscan - search the disks for LVM volume groups

SYNOPSIS
       vgscan

DESCRIPTION
       vgscan reads all disks and reports each volume group it finds, with a
       line like: Found volume group "rhel" using metadata type lvm2. LVM
       normally notices new disks by itself; vgscan is a quick check after
       attaching disks that already hold LVM data.

EXAMPLES
           vgscan

SEE ALSO
       pvscan(8), lvscan(8), vgs(8)
